<title>USA: Art's-Way Q2 Nov 30 full results.</title>
<headline>Art's-Way Q2 Nov 30 full results.</headline>
<dateline>ARMSTRONG, Iowa 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>(All figures in thousands of dollars, except per share)</p>
<p>							 Quarter Ended</p>
<p>					 Nov. 30, 1996    Nov. 30, 1995</p>
<p> Net Sales				    $ 3,320	   $ 3,514</p>
<p> EBITDA (a)					  39		 (7)</p>
<p> Income (Loss) Before Income Taxes	(195)	     (260)</p>
<p> Income Tax Expense (Benefit)		(68)		(91)</p>
